# 🌐 Build Your Own Social Media API

A robust and feature-rich RESTful API for a modern social media application built with **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **MongoDB (Mongoose)**.

## 🚀 Features

- ✅ User Registration & Login (JWT Auth)
- ✅ User Profile View & Update
- ✅ Create, View, Like, and Comment on Posts
- ✅ Follow/Unfollow other users
- ✅ Secure API endpoints using middleware
- ✅ RESTful API design

---

